      "content": "It is understandable that you feel skeptical when reaching out, as transactional support doesn't feel like the genuine connection you crave. However, sometimes talking to a professional provides a safe space to acknowledge the pain of that broken social contract without the pressure of expecting it to immediately \"fix\" the world. Even if it's just a moment to voice the enormity of your unrecognized suffering, that acknowledgement itself is a necessary step in survival. Please consider trying a service just to let someone witness the reality you are currently facing.",
